  "_meta": {
    "step": "motivation",
    "source": "Rogue Trader Core Rulebook + Into the Storm",
    "status": "Core reconciled-by-hand from Core book pp.30-31. Into the Storm 'New Motivation Options' reconciled from ItS pp.25-27 (printed folios; PDF pages 26-28). Verify vs errata.",
    "scope": "Core (Endurance/Fortune/Vengeance/Renown/Pride/Prestige) plus the nine Into the Storm advanced Motivation picks. ItS groups three sub-options under each broad heading (Devotion / Knowledge / Fear); each concrete sub-option is its own selectable record carrying its printed xp_cost (ItS p.25: 'pick a single option ... and pay the listed amount of xp'), named 'Heading - Option'. Devotion may replace Endurance or Renown; Knowledge may replace Vengeance or Pride; Fear may replace ANY entry (substitutes_for lists all six Core motivations). XP costs verified against ItS page text AND the AllowStorm-gated Excel StormMotivationOptionList (the six Devotion/Knowledge costs match). NOTE: the Excel StormMotivationOptionList ALSO lists 'New Horizons' (200), 'The Thrill of War' (250), and 'No Joy Unexplored' (200) -- these are NOT in the Into the Storm Motivation chapter (multi-system bleed-through from other supplements) and are EXCLUDED, matching the Core+ItS scope. ItS Advanced Origins is the human path, so each ItS pick requires species Human.",
    "rules_qa": [
      "Provenance pages are PRINTED FOLIOS (ItS folio = PDF page index - 1).",
      "Devotion (in place of Endurance or Renown) -> Creed 200 (Charm+Common Lore (Imperial Creed) trained; Inspire Wrath), Duty 100 (Armour of Contempt OR Unshakeable Faith; +3 WP), Loyalty 100 (Trade (Voidfarer) trained; +5 WP & Fel while aboard the ship the character lives on).",
      "Knowledge (in place of Vengeance or Pride) -> Knowledge is Life 300 (two Scholastic Lore trained; Total Recall; optional +200xp third Scholastic Lore), Know Thy Foe 200 (one Forbidden Lore trained; optional +100xp second), Knowledge is Power 300 (one Common Lore or Scholastic Lore trained; Foresight; +3 Int or Per).",
      "Fear (in place of ANY entry) -> Enemy in Ascendance 100 (Paranoia; +3 Per), Haunted by Thy Own Sins 300 (Dark Soul+Frenzy+Flagellant; one Forbidden Lore as untrained basic; 1d10 Corruption), Tormented by the Unspeakable 200 (Light Sleeper+Jaded+Resistance (Fear); 2d10 Insanity).",
      "Flagellant is an ItS talent (ItS p.27 sidebar); granted by Haunted by Thy Own Sins. Excel Motivation names map: 'Haunted'=Haunted by Thy Own Sins (300), 'Tormented'=Tormented by the Unspeakable (200), 'Enemy in Ascendance'=100, 'Creed'=200, 'Duty'=100, 'Loyalty'=100, 'Knowledge is Life'=300, 'Know thy Foe'=200, 'Knowledge is Power'=300.",
      "Optional extra-xp purchases (Knowledge is Life 3rd Scholastic Lore +200xp, Know Thy Foe 2nd Forbidden Lore +100xp) are modelled as nested 'choice' effects whose 'take it' option carries an origin_xp_cost (hard-debited from the 500 pool, blocking on overspend) plus the extra grant_skill; the 'skip' option (the default) costs nothing. Knowledge is Life's two base Scholastic Lores are two choices sharing distinct_group 'knowledge_is_life_lores' (must differ).",
      "EXCLUDED multi-system Excel rows: New Horizons (200), The Thrill of War (250), No Joy Unexplored (200) -- not present in the ItS Motivation chapter; flag for QA if a different supplement should be in scope."
    ],
